(5920774, 863615, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice use of the rule of thirds and using the pier as a lead in line.. I would have considered straitening the leading post and removing that boat in the back ground. Two other things to consider would be to give it a more panoramic crop as the sky is a bit uniform and maybe the other side of the pier would have given you a better angle as the pier is bending away from you in this shot.</td>', 'nice use of the rule of thirds and using the pier as a lead in line.. I would have considered straitening the leading post and removing that boat in the back ground. Two other things to consider would be to give it a more panoramic crop as the sky is a bit uniform and maybe the other side of the pier would have given you a better angle as the pier is bending away from you in this shot.', '2010-03-29 08:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
