(5921042, 863314, 74911, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, good arrangement, and composition. But the lighting seems little harsh and is creating unpleasant shadows. And also, the border. I understand you wanted to bring the same color combination as the subjects (blue and orange) but the blue is overwhelming for a border.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Nice subject, good arrangement, and composition. But the lighting seems little harsh and is creating unpleasant shadows. And also, the border. I understand you wanted to bring the same color combination as the subjects (blue and orange) but the blue is overwhelming for a border. Raj', '2010-03-29 11:42:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921044, 863623, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great colors.</td>', 'Great colors.', '2010-03-29 11:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921045, 863173, 74911, '<td valign="top">Great attempt of drop shots.</td>', 'Great attempt of drop shots.', '2010-03-29 11:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921048, 863411, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really inventive and creative shot!  Love the out of the box thinking on this shot!  Love the focus, and DOF as well.  Now, if only you''d put a couple of dabs of orange on the little tree, voters wouldn''t be forced to say..."there''s no ORANGE in it" ROFL!!!  10 from me!</td>', 'Really inventive and creative shot!  Love the out of the box thinking on this shot!  Love the focus, and DOF as well.  Now, if only you''d put a couple of dabs of orange on the little tree, voters wouldn''t be forced to say..."there''s no ORANGE in it" ROFL!!!  10 from me!', '2010-03-29 11:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921049, 863649, 74911, '<td valign="top">I like the placement of the subject on a wooden chest. But compositionally, I would have cut some of the portion at the bottom and left some space in the left side. Just my thoughts.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'I like the placement of the subject on a wooden chest. But compositionally, I would have cut some of the portion at the bottom and left some space in the left side. Just my thoughts. Raj', '2010-03-29 11:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921051, 863562, 68947, '<td valign="top">Nice one!  That must have taken some work and time.  Really great macro!</td>', 'Nice one!  That must have taken some work and time.  Really great macro!', '2010-03-29 11:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921052, 863656, 68947, '<td valign="top">I really like this one.  Of course, the processing isn''t likely to fly in here but, I really like the depth it seems to have with the almost transparent ground!  8</td>', 'I really like this one.  Of course, the processing isn''t likely to fly in here but, I really like the depth it seems to have with the almost transparent ground!  8', '2010-03-29 11:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921053, 863336, 68947, '<td valign="top">What a shot to have caught!!!</td>', 'What a shot to have caught!!!', '2010-03-29 11:47:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921055, 862969, 68947, '<td valign="top">The flash on this is a little harsh and the corner of the walls cuts into the composition a bit.  If you had have been able to have gotten straight in front of it to aim, it would have been great.  Mind you...then you''d have had a problem with the reflection in the mirror. LOL  This was a difficult shot to get a great shot of.</td>', 'The flash on this is a little harsh and the corner of the walls cuts into the composition a bit.  If you had have been able to have gotten straight in front of it to aim, it would have been great.  Mind you...then you''d have had a problem with the reflection in the mirror. LOL  This was a difficult shot to get a great shot of.', '2010-03-29 11:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921058, 863465, 68947, '<td valign="top">Ooooo...very artsy!!!  Love it!  Quite different from the usual advertisement style shots! LOL  8</td>', 'Ooooo...very artsy!!!  Love it!  Quite different from the usual advertisement style shots! LOL  8', '2010-03-29 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921062, 863616, 68947, '<td valign="top">Lovely still life shot.  You know that the processing is going to be the downfall with this one but, I like it.</td>', 'Lovely still life shot.  You know that the processing is going to be the downfall with this one but, I like it.', '2010-03-29 11:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921063, 863474, 68947, '<td valign="top">I''m sure that this one will do very well.  Beautiful scene.  You''re lucky to have had it to shoot and it was well shot. :)</td>', 'I''m sure that this one will do very well.  Beautiful scene.  You''re lucky to have had it to shoot and it was well shot. :)', '2010-03-29 11:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921065, 863660, 68947, '<td valign="top">Really interesting set up and lighting!</td>', 'Really interesting set up and lighting!', '2010-03-29 11:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921068, 862346, 68947, '<td valign="top">Very cool effects!  I''m seeing more and more photogs in here now, trying to change the typical look of photos in these challenges and I''m LOVING it!  9</td>', 'Very cool effects!  I''m seeing more and more photogs in here now, trying to change the typical look of photos in these challenges and I''m LOVING it!  9', '2010-03-29 11:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921069, 863542, 68947, '<td valign="top">Love the clarity of the shot and the blue as the complimentary colour to orange.  The white halo like look around the edge of the orange though, makes it look like a cut and paste/added and cloned layer.</td>', 'Love the clarity of the shot and the blue as the complimentary colour to orange.  The white halo like look around the edge of the orange though, makes it look like a cut and paste/added and cloned layer.', '2010-03-29 11:55:56.000000', NULL, 1);
