(5921616, 863508, 113591, '<td valign="top">Burning the white area would have made it easier on the eye, and perhaps just shifted a tad to the left?</td>', 'Burning the white area would have made it easier on the eye, and perhaps just shifted a tad to the left?', '2010-03-29 17:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921618, 862701, 113591, '<td valign="top">Glad I don''t have to crawl through all those rings!</td>', 'Glad I don''t have to crawl through all those rings!', '2010-03-29 17:55:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921619, 863407, 115307, '<td valign="top">Love this! Vibrant orange, and I love the symmetry in their legs.<br/>I absolutely see why you chose to crop out their faces, and I think that was a good choice on your part. However, it is kind of odd that the viewing of the ring is so high up in the frame, it really makes my eyes want to look higher. Maybe you could have cropped at the shoulder instead, or changed the camera angle?<br/>I don''t know, its tough, I see why and I like the cropping you chose, but at the same time it bugs me.<br/>Regardless, I still love the shot! 9</td>', 'Love this! Vibrant orange, and I love the symmetry in their legs.I absolutely see why you chose to crop out their faces, and I think that was a good choice on your part. However, it is kind of odd that the viewing of the ring is so high up in the frame, it really makes my eyes want to look higher. Maybe you could have cropped at the shoulder instead, or changed the camera angle?I don''t know, its tough, I see why and I like the cropping you chose, but at the same time it bugs me.Regardless, I still love the shot! 9', '2010-03-29 17:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921621, 863659, 113591, '<td valign="top">Very appropriate border</td>', 'Very appropriate border', '2010-03-29 17:57:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921622, 863131, 113591, '<td valign="top">These formations never ceases to amaze me.</td>', 'These formations never ceases to amaze me.', '2010-03-29 17:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921625, 862506, 115307, '<td valign="top">This looks red to me, and the tiny strings that go over the right eye kind of bug me.<br/>However, I like that you can see the contours of the face through the fabric, and composition wise this image is interesting.<br/>I am going to give this a 5 for now, but possibly re-calibrate my monitor in case it is off, and then come back and see if this looks any more orange to me.</td>', 'This looks red to me, and the tiny strings that go over the right eye kind of bug me.However, I like that you can see the contours of the face through the fabric, and composition wise this image is interesting.I am going to give this a 5 for now, but possibly re-calibrate my monitor in case it is off, and then come back and see if this looks any more orange to me.', '2010-03-29 18:01:29.000000', NULL, 1),
