(5921727, 863687, 57447, '<td valign="top">Excellent entry.</td>', 'Excellent entry.', '2010-03-29 19:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921730, 863319, 115307, '<td valign="top">While this photo does contain orange and is in focus, the main thing it lacks is composition. A huge part of photography is presenting a subject matter in an interesting way. You might have tried shooting from a different angle, including the entire lift truck, or shooting at a time when those people were not present.<br/>I am not trying to rag on this photo, I merely am offering a suggestion for next time.</td>', 'While this photo does contain orange and is in focus, the main thing it lacks is composition. A huge part of photography is presenting a subject matter in an interesting way. You might have tried shooting from a different angle, including the entire lift truck, or shooting at a time when those people were not present.I am not trying to rag on this photo, I merely am offering a suggestion for next time.', '2010-03-29 19:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921732, 863411, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful image. Unfortunately it just does not include any orange, and for me DNMC.</td>', 'This is a very beautiful image. Unfortunately it just does not include any orange, and for me DNMC.', '2010-03-29 19:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921737, 863416, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is certainly orange. However, I do not find this image particularly interesting to look at. Particularly the glare is distracting for me.</td>', 'This is certainly orange. However, I do not find this image particularly interesting to look at. Particularly the glare is distracting for me.', '2010-03-29 19:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921741, 863644, 115307, '<td valign="top">This photo has a strange unnatural tinge that is especially noticeable in the blue looking grass (or what I assume is grass). Correcting this would I think improve the image quality.</td>', 'This photo has a strange unnatural tinge that is especially noticeable in the blue looking grass (or what I assume is grass). Correcting this would I think improve the image quality.', '2010-03-29 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921743, 863493, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very fresh and beautiful. I feel like I could eat this orange piece right now, and it is my favorite of the fruit pictures. I especially love the crisp detail and the composition you chose.<br/>There is a dark bubble in the bottom left corner that is distracting for me, and I would have gotten rid of that with spot editing.</td>', 'Very fresh and beautiful. I feel like I could eat this orange piece right now, and it is my favorite of the fruit pictures. I especially love the crisp detail and the composition you chose.There is a dark bubble in the bottom left corner that is distracting for me, and I would have gotten rid of that with spot editing.', '2010-03-29 19:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921746, 862335, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is certainly an interesting photo and I do like it, but I do not really see the emphasis on the color orange. I am not saying that it does not meet the challenge (it does), I am just saying that it does not meet the challenge as well as many other entries, which is why I am not giving this image the score that I might give in a free study or better fitting challenge.</td>', 'This is certainly an interesting photo and I do like it, but I do not really see the emphasis on the color orange. I am not saying that it does not meet the challenge (it does), I am just saying that it does not meet the challenge as well as many other entries, which is why I am not giving this image the score that I might give in a free study or better fitting challenge.', '2010-03-29 19:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921750, 863301, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think getting away from the cat, and shooting at eye level of the cat would have been more effective. I find that especially with pet pictures, being on the same eye level makes a huge difference.<br/>Still, the photo is orange, it is in focus, and the composition is interesting.</td>', 'I think getting away from the cat, and shooting at eye level of the cat would have been more effective. I find that especially with pet pictures, being on the same eye level makes a huge difference.Still, the photo is orange, it is in focus, and the composition is interesting.', '2010-03-29 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921754, 863467, 115307, '<td valign="top">The circle of light in the background that separates the vase from the flowers is very effective here. Well done!</td>', 'The circle of light in the background that separates the vase from the flowers is very effective here. Well done!', '2010-03-29 20:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921759, 863021, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Poppy! I love the rich colors of it.<br/>I do find the orange background on the, left which must be another poppy, very distracting. I think this poppy would stand out better if it was surrounded by a purely green background which you could have achieved by changing your camera position a little.</td>', 'Beautiful Poppy! I love the rich colors of it.I do find the orange background on the, left which must be another poppy, very distracting. I think this poppy would stand out better if it was surrounded by a purely green background which you could have achieved by changing your camera position a little.', '2010-03-29 20:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921837, 863330, 113411, '<td valign="top">Really well done. Great composition.</td>', 'Really well done. Great composition.', '2010-03-29 21:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921842, 863697, 113411, '<td valign="top">Really clever and very well presented!</td>', 'Really clever and very well presented!', '2010-03-29 21:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921843, 863698, 113411, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and color.</td>', 'Nice composition and color.', '2010-03-29 21:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921868, 863597, 115345, '<td valign="top">sorry, it just doesn''t gel with me but maybe I''m in a bad mood...  No criticism I can make other than it doesn''t have any impact for me</td>', 'sorry, it just doesn''t gel with me but maybe I''m in a bad mood...  No criticism I can make other than it doesn''t have any impact for me', '2010-03-29 21:49:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921870, 863659, 115345, '<td valign="top">sorry, this one doesn''t grab me.  Wondering perhaps if it is too cluttered with the toys and bottles.  Maybe if it was just the speaker/amp and mike would have worked better for me.  I like the way the mike and it''s shadow intrude on the scene but don''t like the clutter at the top</td>', 'sorry, this one doesn''t grab me.  Wondering perhaps if it is too cluttered with the toys and bottles.  Maybe if it was just the speaker/amp and mike would have worked better for me.  I like the way the mike and it''s shadow intrude on the scene but don''t like the clutter at the top', '2010-03-29 21:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921872, 862969, 115345, '<td valign="top">this one doesn''t really grab me at all.  Also I think the way it appears to be at a slight leaning angle and also the way the column on the left obscures part of it doesn''t help.  Maybe a slightly different angle and perhaps focus more on the detail in the object may have worked better for my taste.</td>', 'this one doesn''t really grab me at all.  Also I think the way it appears to be at a slight leaning angle and also the way the column on the left obscures part of it doesn''t help.  Maybe a slightly different angle and perhaps focus more on the detail in the object may have worked better for my taste.', '2010-03-29 21:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921873, 863411, 115345, '<td valign="top">this is a stunning image!  I love the dreamy, ethereal feel.  A top image, well done!</td>', 'this is a stunning image!  I love the dreamy, ethereal feel.  A top image, well done!', '2010-03-29 21:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921876, 863550, 115345, '<td valign="top">this is a great shot!  Love the atmosphere you have captured.  Brilliant image, well done!</td>', 'this is a great shot!  Love the atmosphere you have captured.  Brilliant image, well done!', '2010-03-29 21:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921879, 863544, 115345, '<td valign="top">Like the composition and interpretation of the challenge.  A pity you didn''t have a view camera and could modify the perspective slightly :) but then it wouldn''t be likely you would be entering it in DP challenge I guess!  Despite that I really like this image and gave it an 8.  Well done.</td>', 'Like the composition and interpretation of the challenge.  A pity you didn''t have a view camera and could modify the perspective slightly :) but then it wouldn''t be likely you would be entering it in DP challenge I guess!  Despite that I really like this image and gave it an 8.  Well done.', '2010-03-29 22:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921880, 863485, 115345, '<td valign="top">very nicely composed and captured</td>', 'very nicely composed and captured', '2010-03-29 22:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921886, 863314, 115345, '<td valign="top">I don''t normally like flower photos but you have done a great composition here and the colours compliment perfectly.  You have a good eye.</td>', 'I don''t normally like flower photos but you have done a great composition here and the colours compliment perfectly.  You have a good eye.', '2010-03-29 22:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
