(5921917, 863542, 12733, '<td valign="top">The brown table in the bckground doesn''t work against the blue, at least not for me.</td>', 'The brown table in the bckground doesn''t work against the blue, at least not for me.', '2010-03-29 22:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921918, 863687, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very interesting abstaction, pretty photo.</td>', 'Very interesting abstaction, pretty photo.', '2010-03-29 22:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921920, 863354, 12733, '<td valign="top">Beautiful reflectons.</td>', 'Beautiful reflectons.', '2010-03-29 22:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921936, 863196, 111808, '<td valign="top">This sunset seascape is beautiful - it embodies much of the good things in the world made tangible. Superb capture - the textures in the water and the sky are outstanding.</td>', 'This sunset seascape is beautiful - it embodies much of the good things in the world made tangible. Superb capture - the textures in the water and the sky are outstanding.', '2010-03-29 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921939, 863491, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is adorable - the little one is so at peace with the world. No worries, no cares, no fears, just trust. Beautiful.</td>', 'This is adorable - the little one is so at peace with the world. No worries, no cares, no fears, just trust. Beautiful.', '2010-03-29 22:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921941, 863697, 115307, '<td valign="top">Is that an apple on the inside?<br/>This is a nice concept and probably difficult, but it is lacking in some quality. The coloring of the inner most layer seems "off", and the top of the fruit borders on overexposed. Perhaps playing with the lighting some more would have fixed both of these issues.<br/>I really like the idea behind this shot though!</td>', 'Is that an apple on the inside?This is a nice concept and probably difficult, but it is lacking in some quality. The coloring of the inner most layer seems "off", and the top of the fruit borders on overexposed. Perhaps playing with the lighting some more would have fixed both of these issues.I really like the idea behind this shot though!', '2010-03-29 23:05:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921943, 863676, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am most intrigued by the background of this image. It is very interesting.<br/>Flower is nicely in focus, and the color meets the challenge.</td>', 'I am most intrigued by the background of this image. It is very interesting.Flower is nicely in focus, and the color meets the challenge.', '2010-03-29 23:06:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921946, 863286, 115307, '<td valign="top">I am curious how/what you photographed in order to get this effect. This sort of image is generally a "taste" vote. Some people like it, some people hate it. Don''t mind any of them, your taste is what matters.</td>', 'I am curious how/what you photographed in order to get this effect. This sort of image is generally a "taste" vote. Some people like it, some people hate it. Don''t mind any of them, your taste is what matters.', '2010-03-29 23:08:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921949, 863329, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful picture. I especially love the texture of the grasses around this poppy, fading between completely out of focus and in focus.<br/>I do think the lighting on the flower might be a bit too bright. Slightly softer lighting (not too much of course, to not lose the contrast) and maybe zooming in a tad more, would give the flower a greater impact.<br/>Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful picture. I especially love the texture of the grasses around this poppy, fading between completely out of focus and in focus.I do think the lighting on the flower might be a bit too bright. Slightly softer lighting (not too much of course, to not lose the contrast) and maybe zooming in a tad more, would give the flower a greater impact.Great job.', '2010-03-29 23:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921952, 863260, 115307, '<td valign="top">For my taste this is a little underexposed. I know that the darkness is what brings out the dimples more, which is the focus of your image. But with the darkness you are also losing part of the orange in the bottom left, which I think is necessary to keep. Good composition</td>', 'For my taste this is a little underexposed. I know that the darkness is what brings out the dimples more, which is the focus of your image. But with the darkness you are also losing part of the orange in the bottom left, which I think is necessary to keep. Good composition', '2010-03-29 23:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921954, 862701, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like the symmetry, but this image needs a wow factor that makes it interesting to the viewer. Good use of orange.</td>', 'I like the symmetry, but this image needs a wow factor that makes it interesting to the viewer. Good use of orange.', '2010-03-29 23:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921956, 863642, 115307, '<td valign="top">The overall image has a very yellow tinge, which is not very pleasing to the eye. This could be corrected either in Photoshop using Curves or Color Balance, or in the camera itself by changing the White Balance.<br/>The face is cute, and certainly orange, but I think voters are going to dock you because this gives a very hurried thrown together impression.</td>', 'The overall image has a very yellow tinge, which is not very pleasing to the eye. This could be corrected either in Photoshop using Curves or Color Balance, or in the camera itself by changing the White Balance.The face is cute, and certainly orange, but I think voters are going to dock you because this gives a very hurried thrown together impression.', '2010-03-29 23:17:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921960, 863668, 115307, '<td valign="top">Abstract, and I like it. I do think the depth of focus could be a little bigger, not to put the entire "flower" into focus, but just to give a little more sharp area to look at.</td>', 'Abstract, and I like it. I do think the depth of focus could be a little bigger, not to put the entire "flower" into focus, but just to give a little more sharp area to look at.', '2010-03-29 23:19:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921964, 863613, 115307, '<td valign="top">While the yellow fish that is making eye contact is clearly the center of focus, I think this picture is nevertheless too busy. There are too many things that are distractions for the eye, like the tail on the bottom left corner, or the fin in the bottom right. A tighter crop might have helped here, but zooming in on one specific target while taking the picture would have been even more effective.<br/>Also, always remember to keep your image as large as allowed without losing too much quality. Some people will vote you down due to mere image size.</td>', 'While the yellow fish that is making eye contact is clearly the center of focus, I think this picture is nevertheless too busy. There are too many things that are distractions for the eye, like the tail on the bottom left corner, or the fin in the bottom right. A tighter crop might have helped here, but zooming in on one specific target while taking the picture would have been even more effective.Also, always remember to keep your image as large as allowed without losing too much quality. Some people will vote you down due to mere image size.', '2010-03-29 23:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921966, 863223, 115307, '<td valign="top">Icelands volcano? A quite popular theme in this challenge for such a rare phenomenon. I do think I like this one best of the volcano shots. Lovely colors and composition.</td>', 'Icelands volcano? A quite popular theme in this challenge for such a rare phenomenon. I do think I like this one best of the volcano shots. Lovely colors and composition.', '2010-03-29 23:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5921967, 863213, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think desaturating was the wrong choice for this challenge. The whole point was to have color (orange), and I think there will be many that will vote you down for this. I do like the different textures that are presented in this picture from the peels, skin, table, leaves etc.</td>', 'I think desaturating was the wrong choice for this challenge. The whole point was to have color (orange), and I think there will be many that will vote you down for this. I do like the different textures that are presented in this picture from the peels, skin, table, leaves etc.', '2010-03-29 23:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
