(5922063, 863674, 115307, '<td valign="top">You know you have succeeded in a portrait of any kind, when the viewer can not look away from the subject''s eyes. Which I can''t!<br/>I truly love this photo. The colors are rich, the composition interesting, the DoF perfect, and THAT EYE!!!!!<br/>10 from me, hope this does well :-)</td>', 'You know you have succeeded in a portrait of any kind, when the viewer can not look away from the subject''s eyes. Which I can''t!I truly love this photo. The colors are rich, the composition interesting, the DoF perfect, and THAT EYE!!!!!10 from me, hope this does well :-)', '2010-03-30 01:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922066, 863478, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors, excellent focus, and very cute kid :-)<br/>The flower seems a little overexposed at some of the tips, but that is a minor nitpick.</td>', 'Beautiful colors, excellent focus, and very cute kid :-)The flower seems a little overexposed at some of the tips, but that is a minor nitpick.', '2010-03-30 02:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922068, 863354, 115307, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the title, but I do like the image.<br/>What I find most interesting is that you can see what appears to be the reflection of a house on the right, but you cannot actually really see the house!</td>', 'I don''t get the title, but I do like the image.What I find most interesting is that you can see what appears to be the reflection of a house on the right, but you cannot actually really see the house!', '2010-03-30 02:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922069, 863087, 115307, '<td valign="top">A more interesting composition (aka not centered) would help this image stand out more. I like the vibrantly orange beak!</td>', 'A more interesting composition (aka not centered) would help this image stand out more. I like the vibrantly orange beak!', '2010-03-30 02:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922070, 863473, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is one of few images where I think the colored border actually helps rather than hurts the image.<br/>Its a basic idea, but executed well.<br/>I find the glare on the red a little distracting though.</td>', 'This is one of few images where I think the colored border actually helps rather than hurts the image.Its a basic idea, but executed well.I find the glare on the red a little distracting though.', '2010-03-30 02:05:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922071, 863471, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very well done. The DoF is superb. I think it really works here that only part of the wings are in focus. It really makes them seem a lot more delicate.</td>', 'Very well done. The DoF is superb. I think it really works here that only part of the wings are in focus. It really makes them seem a lot more delicate.', '2010-03-30 02:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922072, 863029, 115307, '<td valign="top">This is more yellow than orange. While this is a good shot with clean technicals, there is also no denying that it has been done many many times before. I am giving this a 6.</td>', 'This is more yellow than orange. While this is a good shot with clean technicals, there is also no denying that it has been done many many times before. I am giving this a 6.', '2010-03-30 02:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922075, 863689, 115307, '<td valign="top">I see mostly red and not orange here. I do like the image though. Your focus is nice and the composition is interesting. Still I can''t give this image a score that it might otherwise deserve in other challenges for the simple fact that there are many other entries that fulfilled the challenge requirements a lot more closely. 5</td>', 'I see mostly red and not orange here. I do like the image though. Your focus is nice and the composition is interesting. Still I can''t give this image a score that it might otherwise deserve in other challenges for the simple fact that there are many other entries that fulfilled the challenge requirements a lot more closely. 5', '2010-03-30 02:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922077, 863495, 115307, '<td valign="top">My first impression was that this was really red and not orange.<br/>My second impression is really enjoying the spectrum of color this image is providing via the use of perception and distance. The more your eyes follow the leading lines, the more orange you see.<br/>Well done! Any low votes you receive here are from the people who do not give this image enough to time to look at, like I almost did.</td>', 'My first impression was that this was really red and not orange.My second impression is really enjoying the spectrum of color this image is providing via the use of perception and distance. The more your eyes follow the leading lines, the more orange you see.Well done! Any low votes you receive here are from the people who do not give this image enough to time to look at, like I almost did.', '2010-03-30 02:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922078, 862947, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice orange flower, and I enjoy the composition you chose here.</td>', 'Nice orange flower, and I enjoy the composition you chose here.', '2010-03-30 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922079, 863696, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this image needs a little more light to bring out the beauty of these flowers</td>', 'I think this image needs a little more light to bring out the beauty of these flowers', '2010-03-30 02:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922081, 863403, 115307, '<td valign="top">Quite abstract, which is interesting because one would think that paint on a wall would be a mundane thing.<br/>My eye keeps coming back to the nail.</td>', 'Quite abstract, which is interesting because one would think that paint on a wall would be a mundane thing.My eye keeps coming back to the nail.', '2010-03-30 02:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922083, 863629, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors here!<br/>If you look at where the twirly thing seperates from the sun rays on the top left (sorry, I suck at describing) there seems to be a slight imperfection in the sky. I think you could have easily cloned that out. Just a thought for next time.</td>', 'I really like the colors here!If you look at where the twirly thing seperates from the sun rays on the top left (sorry, I suck at describing) there seems to be a slight imperfection in the sky. I think you could have easily cloned that out. Just a thought for next time.', '2010-03-30 02:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922084, 863631, 115307, '<td valign="top">Witty and I like that. I do think that you could have played around with composition a little. You might have been able to find an angle or distance that would be even more interesting.</td>', 'Witty and I like that. I do think that you could have played around with composition a little. You might have been able to find an angle or distance that would be even more interesting.', '2010-03-30 02:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922085, 863574, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really love this image, it is very clever.<br/>I do wish that the goldfish were more in the picture, and not so far to the edges. But I think this must have been an exceedingly difficult image to capture, so I do not mind.</td>', 'I really love this image, it is very clever.I do wish that the goldfish were more in the picture, and not so far to the edges. But I think this must have been an exceedingly difficult image to capture, so I do not mind.', '2010-03-30 02:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922163, 863328, 109353, '<td valign="top">I love the idea and the composition, but I think there is a huge lack of sharpness. The waves in the sand might be improved with a grazing light to enhance the shadows.</td>', 'I love the idea and the composition, but I think there is a huge lack of sharpness. The waves in the sand might be improved with a grazing light to enhance the shadows.', '2010-03-30 07:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922180, 863407, 43463, '<td valign="top">I love this unique presentation - no flowers or fruits - but an interesting slice of life told not by any facial expression but by the laid back stances of body position and of the hands. These ladies are taking a moment to relax from the frenzy of a wedding day to chat and oh and ah over the ring. The orange bridesmaids dresses really pop and is a bold vibrant color here. Love the mood, feel, and composition in this one - one of my few 9''s. Oh and btw I can''t help but look at the photo and wonder - "was this taken at the Wayfarer''s Chapel that overlooks the ocean in Palos Verdes?" I can see the ocean and the pine trees but I don''t remember a bench with metal supports being near the stone pathway (then again it has been several years since I was last there)</td>', 'I love this unique presentation - no flowers or fruits - but an interesting slice of life told not by any facial expression but by the laid back stances of body position and of the hands. These ladies are taking a moment to relax from the frenzy of a wedding day to chat and oh and ah over the ring. The orange bridesmaids dresses really pop and is a bold vibrant color here. Love the mood, feel, and composition in this one - one of my few 9''s. Oh and btw I can''t help but look at the photo and wonder - "was this taken at the Wayfarer''s Chapel that overlooks the ocean in Palos Verdes?" I can see the ocean and the pine trees but I don''t remember a bench with metal supports being near the stone pathway (then again it has been several years since I was last there)', '2010-03-30 09:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922182, 862947, 43463, '<td valign="top">Wonderful placement of subjects within the frame! The flower in the foreground *INSTANTLY* captures my attention and like a Greeter announces and invites me to come on into the meadow. My vision then travels beyond to the backdrop where I see a field of flowers. The bright and bold yellow-orange hues are perfectly captured. This invokes the feel of a bright, breezy and carefree spring day. Hope to see this in the top 5 - 10.</td>', 'Wonderful placement of subjects within the frame! The flower in the foreground *INSTANTLY* captures my attention and like a Greeter announces and invites me to come on into the meadow. My vision then travels beyond to the backdrop where I see a field of flowers. The bright and bold yellow-orange hues are perfectly captured. This invokes the feel of a bright, breezy and carefree spring day. Hope to see this in the top 5 - 10.', '2010-03-30 09:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922187, 863574, 12796, '<td valign="top">great photo. selective saturation is working well for this</td>', 'great photo. selective saturation is working well for this', '2010-03-30 09:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922231, 863427, 113591, '<td valign="top">And I thought Orange was a happy colour!</td>', 'And I thought Orange was a happy colour!', '2010-03-30 11:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
