(5922241, 863698, 113591, '<td valign="top">Can be used in any Juicy Lucy health cafe.</td>', 'Can be used in any Juicy Lucy health cafe.', '2010-03-30 11:23:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922261, 863314, 101536, '<td valign="top">This just shouts ''ORANGE'' perfectly - my favourite! First time I''ve given a 10 for a long time...</td>', 'This just shouts ''ORANGE'' perfectly - my favourite! First time I''ve given a 10 for a long time...', '2010-03-30 12:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922297, 863427, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think some will dock you here, because they don''t see the orange as vibrant enough. But I actually quite like this shot! You have achieved a great mood here, and that would not be possible without the drab color tone. I also love the contrasting green in the background, it has a nice effect.<br/>I think lowering the camera angle would put a little more emphasis on the the rust, and I think there is a little too much horizon tilt.</td>', 'I think some will dock you here, because they don''t see the orange as vibrant enough. But I actually quite like this shot! You have achieved a great mood here, and that would not be possible without the drab color tone. I also love the contrasting green in the background, it has a nice effect.I think lowering the camera angle would put a little more emphasis on the the rust, and I think there is a little too much horizon tilt.', '2010-03-30 13:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922299, 863625, 115307, '<td valign="top">When I look at this image, I find myself wanting to see more of it. The fallen bike in the background is interesting, but we don''t get to see much of it. I think a slightly wider shot would have been more effective. The orange in this picture is so obvious that it does not need to be zoomed in so closely.<br/>I love the DoF you used, especially with the effect on the road. The orange color is also very nice.</td>', 'When I look at this image, I find myself wanting to see more of it. The fallen bike in the background is interesting, but we don''t get to see much of it. I think a slightly wider shot would have been more effective. The orange in this picture is so obvious that it does not need to be zoomed in so closely.I love the DoF you used, especially with the effect on the road. The orange color is also very nice.', '2010-03-30 13:50:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922303, 863415, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love this! It is almost as if this museum watcher has entered the piece of art to become one herself!<br/>Was the clothing she was wearing actually this orange? I can''t help but think that her hair would stand out even better if her clothing didn''t have the orange tinge. Selecting and changing the curves of just the clothing probably would have done the trick.</td>', 'I love this! It is almost as if this museum watcher has entered the piece of art to become one herself!Was the clothing she was wearing actually this orange? I can''t help but think that her hair would stand out even better if her clothing didn''t have the orange tinge. Selecting and changing the curves of just the clothing probably would have done the trick.', '2010-03-30 13:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922310, 863639, 115307, '<td valign="top">Quirky, vibrant and cute! :-)<br/>I love the colors here, and the reflection has a really nice effect. I also love the positioning of everything.<br/>I wish the left flower wasn''t cut off though, I would have loved to see the whole thing. There also seems to be a wood fault on the woody''s face that I think could have easily been cloned out.</td>', 'Quirky, vibrant and cute! :-)I love the colors here, and the reflection has a really nice effect. I also love the positioning of everything.I wish the left flower wasn''t cut off though, I would have loved to see the whole thing. There also seems to be a wood fault on the woody''s face that I think could have easily been cloned out.', '2010-03-30 13:57:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922311, 863691, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat shot. Love the feel of motion and the border.</td>', 'Neat shot. Love the feel of motion and the border.', '2010-03-30 13:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922312, 862466, 23484, '<td valign="top">That''s not nice. You''re making everyone hungry. Neat shot.</td>', 'That''s not nice. You''re making everyone hungry. Neat shot.', '2010-03-30 13:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922313, 863403, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat abstract type image. This could also be used as a great texture.</td>', 'Neat abstract type image. This could also be used as a great texture.', '2010-03-30 13:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922314, 862899, 23484, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of selective desat. Nice sharpness.</td>', 'Excellent use of selective desat. Nice sharpness.', '2010-03-30 14:00:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922315, 863180, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great closeup and DOF.</td>', 'Great closeup and DOF.', '2010-03-30 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922317, 863646, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot. The orange floating thing (I forget the name) in the background becomes very distracting in this challenge particularly, because it is the most orange thing in the picture so the eye is naturally drawn away from the main subject to it.<br/>I really like the composition here. In action shots that can be hard to obtain, so well done.</td>', 'Nice action shot. The orange floating thing (I forget the name) in the background becomes very distracting in this challenge particularly, because it is the most orange thing in the picture so the eye is naturally drawn away from the main subject to it.I really like the composition here. In action shots that can be hard to obtain, so well done.', '2010-03-30 14:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922318, 863314, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the orange on orange. Nicely composed and the border color is perfect.</td>', 'I like the orange on orange. Nicely composed and the border color is perfect.', '2010-03-30 14:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922319, 863485, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat still life image.</td>', 'Neat still life image.', '2010-03-30 14:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922320, 863675, 115307, '<td valign="top">Clever title and I think the centered composition works well here. However, I do think this image is a little overexposed. Just a little darker would have made this more pleasing to the eye, because right now it has a washed out feel.</td>', 'Clever title and I think the centered composition works well here. However, I do think this image is a little overexposed. Just a little darker would have made this more pleasing to the eye, because right now it has a washed out feel.', '2010-03-30 14:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922322, 863355, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very interesting portrait shot. I really like it.</td>', 'Very interesting portrait shot. I really like it.', '2010-03-30 14:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922325, 863196, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure.</td>', 'Nice exposure.', '2010-03-30 14:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922327, 863697, 23484, '<td valign="top">You can compare apples with oranges. Neat idea.</td>', 'You can compare apples with oranges. Neat idea.', '2010-03-30 14:03:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922329, 863638, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice softness and depth of color.</td>', 'Nice softness and depth of color.', '2010-03-30 14:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922335, 863597, 115307, '<td valign="top">While this picture is in clear focus and is certainly interesting, I suspect that it is not doing that great in this challenge. The reason for this is because:<br/>A, DPC doesn''t have a sense of humor :-P <br/>but more importantly<br/>B, This image appears like it has been hurriedly thrown together with little planning. Kind of like "ooooh, I have a basketball hoop, and oooooh I have an orange lion. I am going to place the lion in the basketball hoop and submit it"<br/>Such shots tend to be punished by voters, especially by participants of the same challenge, as they feel like they personally put in more effort.<br/>I am not trying to insult this photo or your preparation for it, I am just trying to explain why you are getting the votes that I suspect you are getting.</td>', 'While this picture is in clear focus and is certainly interesting, I suspect that it is not doing that great in this challenge. The reason for this is because:A, DPC doesn''t have a sense of humor :-P but more importantlyB, This image appears like it has been hurriedly thrown together with little planning. Kind of like "ooooh, I have a basketball hoop, and oooooh I have an orange lion. I am going to place the lion in the basketball hoop and submit it"Such shots tend to be punished by voters, especially by participants of the same challenge, as they feel like they personally put in more effort.I am not trying to insult this photo or your preparation for it, I am just trying to explain why you are getting the votes that I suspect you are getting.', '2010-03-30 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922336, 863698, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice colors here, and I especially like the bubble texture in the glass.<br/>Did you ever try shooting with a slightly darker background? I think that might have helped this shot by lowering the difficulty of it. Right now, it is very hard to achieve the proper exposure for all aspects of this photo, and to me this shows in the two streams of liquid before they enter the glass.</td>', 'Nice colors here, and I especially like the bubble texture in the glass.Did you ever try shooting with a slightly darker background? I think that might have helped this shot by lowering the difficulty of it. Right now, it is very hard to achieve the proper exposure for all aspects of this photo, and to me this shows in the two streams of liquid before they enter the glass.', '2010-03-30 14:10:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922340, 863614, 115307, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo! I especially like the contrast between the blue eyes and everything else. The mask is interesting, and the fingers provide expression that the hidden face cannot otherwise shot.<br/>I wish the right side of her body (especially her eye!) was brighter though. The darkness there kind of detracts for me.<br/>Just put your hand up to the screen and take turns covering up half of the picture. It becomes incredibly obvious how much better the left side is. It is to the point that I would almost suggest cropping the image at the midline of her face (though I suppose that would not be dpc friendly)</td>', 'Very interesting photo! I especially like the contrast between the blue eyes and everything else. The mask is interesting, and the fingers provide expression that the hidden face cannot otherwise shot.I wish the right side of her body (especially her eye!) was brighter though. The darkness there kind of detracts for me.Just put your hand up to the screen and take turns covering up half of the picture. It becomes incredibly obvious how much better the left side is. It is to the point that I would almost suggest cropping the image at the midline of her face (though I suppose that would not be dpc friendly)', '2010-03-30 14:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922341, 863410, 115307, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp flower and a nice even background. I am not sure that the colored border is really necessary.</td>', 'Nice crisp flower and a nice even background. I am not sure that the colored border is really necessary.', '2010-03-30 14:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922356, 863660, 28427, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and colour combination</td>', 'Nice composition and colour combination', '2010-03-30 14:45:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922360, 862384, 12733, '<td valign="top">The figure looks artificially superimposed on the background; he doesn''t seem to fit.</td>', 'The figure looks artificially superimposed on the background; he doesn''t seem to fit.', '2010-03-30 14:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922361, 863467, 28427, '<td valign="top">Clean, simple photograph with a strong effect.</td>', 'Clean, simple photograph with a strong effect.', '2010-03-30 14:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922362, 863564, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very cute; the ladybug actually looks angry.</td>', 'Very cute; the ladybug actually looks angry.', '2010-03-30 14:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922364, 863570, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the adjoining yellow bike and the guy on the cellphone are very distracting.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the adjoining yellow bike and the guy on the cellphone are very distracting.', '2010-03-30 14:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922365, 863644, 12733, '<td valign="top">Not a lot of orange here, and her face is awfully sallow; is that really the color it was?</td>', 'Not a lot of orange here, and her face is awfully sallow; is that really the color it was?', '2010-03-30 14:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922368, 862978, 12733, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I don''t get it. Is it supposed to be mysterious? A puzzle?</td>', 'Sorry, but I don''t get it. Is it supposed to be mysterious? A puzzle?', '2010-03-30 15:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922371, 863642, 12733, '<td valign="top">The peels are garbage, and they detract mightily from the picture. I would guess the title is something of a play on words, but it doesn''t really justify putting garbage into a picture. Must mean a lot to Hugh, though.</td>', 'The peels are garbage, and they detract mightily from the picture. I would guess the title is something of a play on words, but it doesn''t really justify putting garbage into a picture. Must mean a lot to Hugh, though.', '2010-03-30 15:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922372, 863638, 28427, '<td valign="top">I like the soft focus</td>', 'I like the soft focus', '2010-03-30 15:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922373, 863087, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice capture.</td>', 'Nice capture.', '2010-03-30 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922378, 863223, 28427, '<td valign="top">Spectacular! Amazing to see this IRL</td>', 'Spectacular! Amazing to see this IRL', '2010-03-30 15:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922393, 863398, 28427, '<td valign="top">Lol - I thought it was a hen :-D</td>', 'Lol - I thought it was a hen :-D', '2010-03-30 15:40:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922400, 863474, 28427, '<td valign="top">What a difference a few steps can make [thumb]863196[/thumb].  I recognised the spot by the formation in the background.  It''ll be a competition between the both of you because this one gets a *10* as well.</td>', 'What a difference a few steps can make [thumb]863196[/thumb].  I recognised the spot by the formation in the background.  It''ll be a competition between the both of you because this one gets a *10* as well.', '2010-03-30 15:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922414, 863395, 5364, '<td valign="top">Here''s my comments, specifically because you''ve marked it CW<br/> <br/>If I were voting in this challenge I would have given it a 7. I really like the composition and the uncluttered feeling. The balance of it feels just right with his hand close the right edge balanced by the ball at the bottom left. Very nice.</td>', 'Here''s my comments, specifically because you''ve marked it CW If I were voting in this challenge I would have given it a 7. I really like the composition and the uncluttered feeling. The balance of it feels just right with his hand close the right edge balanced by the ball at the bottom left. Very nice.', '2010-03-30 16:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922417, 863688, 5364, '<td valign="top">Here''s my comments, specifically because you''ve marked this CW<br/> <br/>If I were voting in this challenge I would have given you a 4. I think you''ve chosen a good subject and the orange mesh is a good idea. I feel the main problem is a lack of sharpness. Everything looks a bit fuzzy to me.</td>', 'Here''s my comments, specifically because you''ve marked this CW If I were voting in this challenge I would have given you a 4. I think you''ve chosen a good subject and the orange mesh is a good idea. I feel the main problem is a lack of sharpness. Everything looks a bit fuzzy to me.', '2010-03-30 16:28:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922423, 862935, 5364, '<td valign="top">Here''s my comments, specifically because you''ve marked it CW<br/> <br/>If I was voting in this challenge I would have given you a 8. It gives me a real feeling of tranquillity. The composition is just right with the bubble off centre. I like it.</td>', 'Here''s my comments, specifically because you''ve marked it CW If I was voting in this challenge I would have given you a 8. It gives me a real feeling of tranquillity. The composition is just right with the bubble off centre. I like it.', '2010-03-30 16:31:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922425, 863688, 113591, '<td valign="top">Good background choice, well lit.</td>', 'Good background choice, well lit.', '2010-03-30 16:32:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922427, 863632, 113591, '<td valign="top">I like this very much, 8</td>', 'I like this very much, 8', '2010-03-30 16:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922431, 863474, 113591, '<td valign="top">You must have enjoyed being at that scene. Majestic</td>', 'You must have enjoyed being at that scene. Majestic', '2010-03-30 16:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922436, 863663, 113591, '<td valign="top">This is a very good photo of a Gerbera Jamesonii - the Barberton daisy. I live in the town Barberton, where these plants were first discovered. But did I submit such a nice entry? Nooo, I''m too obtuse.</td>', 'This is a very good photo of a Gerbera Jamesonii - the Barberton daisy. I live in the town Barberton, where these plants were first discovered. But did I submit such a nice entry? Nooo, I''m too obtuse.', '2010-03-30 16:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922441, 863694, 99263, '<td valign="top">Great detail and lovely rendition of orange color.</td>', 'Great detail and lovely rendition of orange color.', '2010-03-30 16:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922468, 863314, 115307, '<td valign="top">Well, this image certainly is orange. The flowers are nice and I especially like the composition, and the way the flowers lean into the rest of the frame.<br/>However, I think you should have chosen a lighter or more desaturated orange background maybe. It is so orange that it overwhelms the flowers a little. I think ideally the flowers should be the most orange thing in this picture</td>', 'Well, this image certainly is orange. The flowers are nice and I especially like the composition, and the way the flowers lean into the rest of the frame.However, I think you should have chosen a lighter or more desaturated orange background maybe. It is so orange that it overwhelms the flowers a little. I think ideally the flowers should be the most orange thing in this picture', '2010-03-30 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922469, 863333, 115307, '<td valign="top">Teeheehee, my favorite thing about this image is the crane''s tail. It is so puny! :-P<br/>Beautiful orange coloring and I love the texture of the water.<br/>Composition wise, I don''t know if I like the crane heading out of the frame. I would have rather seen him in the top right corner or something. But that is minor, and its not like wildlife likes to cooperate.</td>', 'Teeheehee, my favorite thing about this image is the crane''s tail. It is so puny! :-PBeautiful orange coloring and I love the texture of the water.Composition wise, I don''t know if I like the crane heading out of the frame. I would have rather seen him in the top right corner or something. But that is minor, and its not like wildlife likes to cooperate.', '2010-03-30 17:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922472, 863283, 115307, '<td valign="top">In an orange challenge, I think it was a poor choice of titling to call him Mr. Red. I think that might be just asking the trolls and grumpy people to give you a low score for not meeting the challenge.<br/>I really like the composition of the picture. The whispy branches make an interesting background and I like the crossing trunks. However, I would have liked to see the squirrel be in more focus.</td>', 'In an orange challenge, I think it was a poor choice of titling to call him Mr. Red. I think that might be just asking the trolls and grumpy people to give you a low score for not meeting the challenge.I really like the composition of the picture. The whispy branches make an interesting background and I like the crossing trunks. However, I would have liked to see the squirrel be in more focus.', '2010-03-30 17:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922477, 863615, 115307, '<td valign="top">The best of the orange sunsets that I have seen so far in this challenge. I love that a full spectrum is given from almost red to almost yellow.</td>', 'The best of the orange sunsets that I have seen so far in this challenge. I love that a full spectrum is given from almost red to almost yellow.', '2010-03-30 17:31:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922482, 863561, 115307, '<td valign="top">This picture tells me blue instead of orange. I know that there is orange, but it is not the main focus in my opinion. I also think that this image is too black. <br/>The color tones are very pretty though</td>', 'This picture tells me blue instead of orange. I know that there is orange, but it is not the main focus in my opinion. I also think that this image is too black. The color tones are very pretty though', '2010-03-30 17:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922483, 863318, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really like the different shading of the smoke in this picture, going between grey, orange and red.<br/>I am sure you know that this picture is very grainy, which kind of detracts for me. Interestingly the mountains do not appear to have as much grain. Maybe cropping towards the bottom of half of the picture would make the noise less overwhelming.</td>', 'I really like the different shading of the smoke in this picture, going between grey, orange and red.I am sure you know that this picture is very grainy, which kind of detracts for me. Interestingly the mountains do not appear to have as much grain. Maybe cropping towards the bottom of half of the picture would make the noise less overwhelming.', '2010-03-30 17:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922488, 863374, 115307, '<td valign="top">Clever idea, and something different from the many many orange flower shots in this challenge :-)<br/>I especially like that you included the different stages of the painting, with one untouched, one in the process, and one practically finished.<br/>If the hand (your hand?) was situated more in the top left corner and angling downwards, I think the composition would be even more pleasing.</td>', 'Clever idea, and something different from the many many orange flower shots in this challenge :-)I especially like that you included the different stages of the painting, with one untouched, one in the process, and one practically finished.If the hand (your hand?) was situated more in the top left corner and angling downwards, I think the composition would be even more pleasing.', '2010-03-30 17:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922491, 863303, 115307, '<td valign="top">While I can see no technical flaws in this picture, it lacks the creativity of other photos in this challenge that would warrant a high score.<br/>I do like that there is so much emphasis on texture, both on the peels and what I assume is a table.</td>', 'While I can see no technical flaws in this picture, it lacks the creativity of other photos in this challenge that would warrant a high score.I do like that there is so much emphasis on texture, both on the peels and what I assume is a table.', '2010-03-30 17:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922494, 863378, 115307, '<td valign="top">This picture needs a sharper focus in order to work out well. If you were having trouble with this, maybe a larger aperture would make the focus easier. I also think that the white paper things distract away from the jelly beans</td>', 'This picture needs a sharper focus in order to work out well. If you were having trouble with this, maybe a larger aperture would make the focus easier. I also think that the white paper things distract away from the jelly beans', '2010-03-30 17:40:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922497, 862954, 115307, '<td valign="top">In my opinion, this is over processed to the point that you are losing the details in the image. I think that if the flower was less over saturated you would be able to see it more clearly and it would look nicer.<br/>I do like the processing effect on the green stems however. It works there.<br/>I also like that you included a smiley face in your title :-)</td>', 'In my opinion, this is over processed to the point that you are losing the details in the image. I think that if the flower was less over saturated you would be able to see it more clearly and it would look nicer.I do like the processing effect on the green stems however. It works there.I also like that you included a smiley face in your title :-)', '2010-03-30 17:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922498, 862949, 115307, '<td valign="top">Abstract and I like it. One of the more clever and creative ways of showing the same old fruit in this challenge.<br/>I do think for this to work more effectively it needs to be a little brighter and a little sharper.</td>', 'Abstract and I like it. One of the more clever and creative ways of showing the same old fruit in this challenge.I do think for this to work more effectively it needs to be a little brighter and a little sharper.', '2010-03-30 17:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922500, 863480, 115307, '<td valign="top">This picture would not work without the title, because it would be pretty boring. But with the title, I love it :-)<br/>Everything is sharply in focus, and I like how you managed to align them to perfection</td>', 'This picture would not work without the title, because it would be pretty boring. But with the title, I love it :-)Everything is sharply in focus, and I like how you managed to align them to perfection', '2010-03-30 17:46:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(5922502, 863474, 115307, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous photo. I love the colors and you have captured the silky water perfectly.<br/> I think the emphasis could have been a little more on the sky, at least to the point that it takes up half of the picture as well.</td>', 'Gorgeous photo. I love the colors and you have captured the silky water perfectly. I think the emphasis could have been a little more on the sky, at least to the point that it takes up half of the picture as well.', '2010-03-30 17:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922509, 863407, 63244, '<td valign="top">Lol! love the crop and the quirkiness here...and the empty beer bottle in bride''s hand! FUn capture. I like how you can see the distance UNDER the bench! Great idea!!!</td>', 'Lol! love the crop and the quirkiness here...and the empty beer bottle in bride''s hand! FUn capture. I like how you can see the distance UNDER the bench! Great idea!!!', '2010-03-30 18:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922548, 863456, 23484, '<td valign="top">Beautiful job. Nice tight crop and great exposure.</td>', 'Beautiful job. Nice tight crop and great exposure.', '2010-03-30 19:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922549, 863630, 23484, '<td valign="top">This is cool.</td>', 'This is cool.', '2010-03-30 19:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922550, 863663, 23484, '<td valign="top">I like the off-center composition.</td>', 'I like the off-center composition.', '2010-03-30 19:14:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922551, 863333, 23484, '<td valign="top">The silhouette is very nice. Wouldn''t be nearly as nice without it.</td>', 'The silhouette is very nice. Wouldn''t be nearly as nice without it.', '2010-03-30 19:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922552, 862701, 100831, '<td valign="top">nice pov.</td>', 'nice pov.', '2010-03-30 19:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922554, 863550, 100831, '<td valign="top">Excellent  - fits the subject and what a fabulous image.</td>', 'Excellent  - fits the subject and what a fabulous image.', '2010-03-30 19:18:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922640, 863196, 92577, '<td valign="top">simply wonderful</td>', 'simply wonderful', '2010-03-30 20:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922707, 863690, 100831, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and dof.</td>', 'Beautiful light and dof.', '2010-03-30 22:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922710, 863286, 100831, '<td valign="top">stunning simplicity</td>', 'stunning simplicity', '2010-03-30 22:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922711, 863498, 100831, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot for the almost abstract look and beautiful color</td>', 'I like this a lot for the almost abstract look and beautiful color', '2010-03-30 22:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922751, 863281, 115307, '<td valign="top">I love Fanta! This picture looks crisp and fresh, and I love the bubbles.<br/>In a few of the bubbles there is orange reflected in them. I wish more of them did that, though I don''t know how you would have achieved that.</td>', 'I love Fanta! This picture looks crisp and fresh, and I love the bubbles.In a few of the bubbles there is orange reflected in them. I wish more of them did that, though I don''t know how you would have achieved that.', '2010-03-30 23:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922752, 863478, 57447, '<td valign="top">Is that a snuggie?  This is as good as it gets! 9.</td>', 'Is that a snuggie?  This is as good as it gets! 9.', '2010-03-30 23:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922754, 863395, 109478, '<td valign="top">Nice color and lighting, but the thing that he stood on and the orange in the bottom are distracting.</td>', 'Nice color and lighting, but the thing that he stood on and the orange in the bottom are distracting.', '2010-03-30 23:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922755, 862935, 115307, '<td valign="top">Serene and beautiful. I love this picture most for its simplicity.</td>', 'Serene and beautiful. I love this picture most for its simplicity.', '2010-03-30 23:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922760, 863694, 57447, '<td valign="top">Vivid flower, nice composition.</td>', 'Vivid flower, nice composition.', '2010-03-30 23:09:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922761, 862973, 115307, '<td valign="top">The coloring of this photo is a little strange. While the sweater is orange, the rest of it appears very purple. I think I would have like this better with a more natural tinge. I like "the little engine that could" in the corner. My eye keeps bouncing back between the person and that book.</td>', 'The coloring of this photo is a little strange. While the sweater is orange, the rest of it appears very purple. I think I would have like this better with a more natural tinge. I like "the little engine that could" in the corner. My eye keeps bouncing back between the person and that book.', '2010-03-30 23:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922769, 863180, 57447, '<td valign="top">The flower is beautiful, would like to see more of the frame filled with the flower.</td>', 'The flower is beautiful, would like to see more of the frame filled with the flower.', '2010-03-30 23:13:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922777, 862384, 57447, '<td valign="top">Ha..cute.</td>', 'Ha..cute.', '2010-03-30 23:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922895, 863120, 41357, '<td valign="top">Why would I want to take her out?<br/>why would I want her dressed in the first place?<br/> <br/>I''m not voting (all that orange hurts my eyes) but this is a well taken sexy shot.</td>', 'Why would I want to take her out?why would I want her dressed in the first place? I''m not voting (all that orange hurts my eyes) but this is a well taken sexy shot.', '2010-03-31 01:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5922913, 862335, 41357, '<td valign="top">here the orange kind of kills the picture (I would have used white background)<br/>still its a very good / fun picture<br/>(sorry not voting)</td>', 'here the orange kind of kills the picture (I would have used white background)still its a very good / fun picture(sorry not voting)', '2010-03-31 01:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
