(5923758, 862466, 115307, '<td valign="top">The picture frame in the background of this picture completely distracts away from your main subject.<br/>It is to the point that I practically do not look at the main subject in favor for that.</td>', 'The picture frame in the background of this picture completely distracts away from your main subject.It is to the point that I practically do not look at the main subject in favor for that.', '2010-03-31 16:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923760, 862899, 115307, '<td valign="top">This must have been set up, yes? I can think of no coincidence in which a woman with an orange shirts and oranges and a orange soda are all in a orange labeled booth.<br/>Still, I like this shot. The desaturation of everything else works very well.</td>', 'This must have been set up, yes? I can think of no coincidence in which a woman with an orange shirts and oranges and a orange soda are all in a orange labeled booth.Still, I like this shot. The desaturation of everything else works very well.', '2010-03-31 16:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923763, 862499, 115307, '<td valign="top">The fish in the background distracts me away from the main fish a little. I can''t decide whether I dislike that, or if I think that it adds an element to the picture. I guess I am neutral to this picture.</td>', 'The fish in the background distracts me away from the main fish a little. I can''t decide whether I dislike that, or if I think that it adds an element to the picture. I guess I am neutral to this picture.', '2010-03-31 16:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923765, 862970, 115307, '<td valign="top">Beautiful flower and crisp detail, but I don''t know about the composition chosen here. There is nothing specific I can suggest for improvement, but I suspect this might have stood out even better with a different one. 6</td>', 'Beautiful flower and crisp detail, but I don''t know about the composition chosen here. There is nothing specific I can suggest for improvement, but I suspect this might have stood out even better with a different one. 6', '2010-03-31 16:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923770, 863206, 115307, '<td valign="top">The boat seems a little soft to me.<br/>I like the line and the pieces of wood in the water, that forcefully lead to the subject. The building are also a nice shade of orange.</td>', 'The boat seems a little soft to me.I like the line and the pieces of wood in the water, that forcefully lead to the subject. The building are also a nice shade of orange.', '2010-03-31 16:55:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923771, 863695, 115307, '<td valign="top">I think this image would have worked better if either the person was in sharper focus, or there was no person.<br/>Cute drawings :-)</td>', 'I think this image would have worked better if either the person was in sharper focus, or there was no person.Cute drawings :-)', '2010-03-31 16:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923775, 863395, 115307, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture and good use of orange. But what is he standing on?<br/>I really love the shirt, it is in good focus and an orange that is very pleasing to the eye.<br/>However, I also feel like the orange ball in the bottom left is distracting, and that the vignetting just darkens the picture a lot.</td>', 'Interesting picture and good use of orange. But what is he standing on?I really love the shirt, it is in good focus and an orange that is very pleasing to the eye.However, I also feel like the orange ball in the bottom left is distracting, and that the vignetting just darkens the picture a lot.', '2010-03-31 16:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923777, 863312, 115307, '<td valign="top">Good contrast between the orange carrots and the green leaves.<br/>I would have liked to see the tips of the carrots on the bottom (or cropped more tightly so it is not as obvious that only the very tips are missing). This way, I find myself just staring at the bottom edge of the photo.</td>', 'Good contrast between the orange carrots and the green leaves.I would have liked to see the tips of the carrots on the bottom (or cropped more tightly so it is not as obvious that only the very tips are missing). This way, I find myself just staring at the bottom edge of the photo.', '2010-03-31 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923782, 863601, 115307, '<td valign="top">One of the more interesting volcano shots. I love the colors and the millions of little dots of lava.<br/>But I really really feel like the people should have been in sharper focus. Especially the two blurry ones on the left are very distracting. It is the people''s silhouettes that make this photograph interesting and sets it apart from the other volcano shots, so the fact that they are not all in focus is a downer. For me, it makes the difference between giving you a 6 and an 8.</td>', 'One of the more interesting volcano shots. I love the colors and the millions of little dots of lava.But I really really feel like the people should have been in sharper focus. Especially the two blurry ones on the left are very distracting. It is the people''s silhouettes that make this photograph interesting and sets it apart from the other volcano shots, so the fact that they are not all in focus is a downer. For me, it makes the difference between giving you a 6 and an 8.', '2010-03-31 17:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923788, 863492, 115307, '<td valign="top">I like the humor in this image, and I love how they all have legs and arms.<br/>However, it seems obvious to me that this was a fairly simple shot, so it cannot get one of the highest scores from me.</td>', 'I like the humor in this image, and I love how they all have legs and arms.However, it seems obvious to me that this was a fairly simple shot, so it cannot get one of the highest scores from me.', '2010-03-31 17:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923792, 863551, 115307, '<td valign="top">This looks really really good as a thumb! However, up close there appear to be some quality issues, especially around the eyes. Perhaps over sharpened? Unfortunately, that makes a big difference for me, scoring wise.<br/>I do love the colors and the expression.</td>', 'This looks really really good as a thumb! However, up close there appear to be some quality issues, especially around the eyes. Perhaps over sharpened? Unfortunately, that makes a big difference for me, scoring wise.I do love the colors and the expression.', '2010-03-31 17:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923794, 863544, 115307, '<td valign="top">I really think this photograph needed to be in color. Possibly waiting until the car was moved would also give more emphasis on the picture on the wall.<br/>Otherwise, this is a unique shot, and I especially like the cloud cover.</td>', 'I really think this photograph needed to be in color. Possibly waiting until the car was moved would also give more emphasis on the picture on the wall.Otherwise, this is a unique shot, and I especially like the cloud cover.', '2010-03-31 17:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923808, 862947, 116088, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF and excellent POV.</td>', 'Nice DOF and excellent POV.', '2010-03-31 17:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923815, 863614, 115983, '<td valign="top">I love this Capture, Very nice tones and great subject... Creative, the blur around the Glitter lips distracts me a little bit.</td>', 'I love this Capture, Very nice tones and great subject... Creative, the blur around the Glitter lips distracts me a little bit.', '2010-03-31 17:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5923816, 863663, 115983, '<td valign="top">The perfect Color of Orange in my book, seems like it could be a little crisper in the focus. Nice Work.</td>', 'The perfect Color of Orange in my book, seems like it could be a little crisper in the focus. Nice Work.', '2010-03-31 17:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
