(5924056, 863407, 38699, '<td valign="top">I like the humor, it really makes you wonder what is really above/under the orange? The lady on the right seems a lot "thicker" than the rest and maybe she isn''t a lady at all; the third orange lady from the right holds that leg in the awkward position just to to keep the visual rhythm with the other legs, and why is the second orange taking the ring from the bride''s finger? Or maybe she does not...this is not clear <br/> <br/>The thing I don''t like that much is the framing: maybe more lateral space especially on the left side would have made the picture more interesting by giving a sense of the (probably) empty location and thus augmenting the ironic vibe.</td>', 'I like the humor, it really makes you wonder what is really above/under the orange? The lady on the right seems a lot "thicker" than the rest and maybe she isn''t a lady at all; the third orange lady from the right holds that leg in the awkward position just to to keep the visual rhythm with the other legs, and why is the second orange taking the ring from the bride''s finger? Or maybe she does not...this is not clear  The thing I don''t like that much is the framing: maybe more lateral space especially on the left side would have made the picture more interesting by giving a sense of the (probably) empty location and thus augmenting the ironic vibe.', '2010-03-31 20:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924100, 863355, 77196, '<td valign="top">IMO, there is something seriously wrong with the perspective in this shot. A huge part of it is the petal eyelashes, but part of it is also that there is not enough information to know if she is standing or lying down. Same for the angle the shot was taken from. Also, she looks young, but may not be. Head size does not seem to match her arms and shoulders. I also find the background distracting. <br/>Lighting, colors, sharpness are all very good. <br/>This is a technically excellent shot. At the same time, I have a negative emotional reaction to it.</td>', 'IMO, there is something seriously wrong with the perspective in this shot. A huge part of it is the petal eyelashes, but part of it is also that there is not enough information to know if she is standing or lying down. Same for the angle the shot was taken from. Also, she looks young, but may not be. Head size does not seem to match her arms and shoulders. I also find the background distracting. Lighting, colors, sharpness are all very good. This is a technically excellent shot. At the same time, I have a negative emotional reaction to it.', '2010-03-31 21:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924113, 862935, 77196, '<td valign="top">IMO this is a bit OOF (with possible exception of the clear bubble). There also seems to be a grainy texture to the orange ripples. Not a bad shot, just missing something - needs a bit of extra pop of some kind.</td>', 'IMO this is a bit OOF (with possible exception of the clear bubble). There also seems to be a grainy texture to the orange ripples. Not a bad shot, just missing something - needs a bit of extra pop of some kind.', '2010-03-31 21:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924114, 863374, 77196, '<td valign="top">Great concept and very well executed. Made me smile.</td>', 'Great concept and very well executed. Made me smile.', '2010-03-31 21:48:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924118, 863395, 77196, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty decent shot. I like the nice orange shirt, and the stop motion capture. However, looking up someone''s nose is not the most pleasant angle. It looks like his feet have been chopped off by (or he''s standing on) an unrecognizable object. I think this would make a great shot in a group of 3 different poses. But, I don''t feel it stands on its own all that well...</td>', 'This is a pretty decent shot. I like the nice orange shirt, and the stop motion capture. However, looking up someone''s nose is not the most pleasant angle. It looks like his feet have been chopped off by (or he''s standing on) an unrecognizable object. I think this would make a great shot in a group of 3 different poses. But, I don''t feel it stands on its own all that well...', '2010-03-31 21:54:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5924120, 863410, 77196, '<td valign="top">My top-rated shot for this challenge. I love the Bird of Paradise, and have an idea of just how difficult it is to get a really good shot of it. This is masterfully done. Nice job.</td>', 'My top-rated shot for this challenge. I love the Bird of Paradise, and have an idea of just how difficult it is to get a really good shot of it. This is masterfully done. Nice job.', '2010-03-31 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
