(5927782, 863644, 103310, '<td valign="top">Nicely spontaneous model. <br/> <br/>Moan that the colours do not happen real realistically. For this reason is photograph in RAW usefully because one can adapt afterwards such corrections. <br/> <br/>Furthermore the left shoulder of the model  seems have over-exposed. Shorter exposure  and/or smaller diaphragm (larger f number) could remedy this. Other solution is not in fuk sun on afternoon photograph hour, differently with parasol sun what screens.</td>', 'Nicely spontaneous model.  Moan that the colours do not happen real realistically. For this reason is photograph in RAW usefully because one can adapt afterwards such corrections.  Furthermore the left shoulder of the model  seems have over-exposed. Shorter exposure  and/or smaller diaphragm (larger f number) could remedy this. Other solution is not in fuk sun on afternoon photograph hour, differently with parasol sun what screens.', '2010-04-02 18:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
