(5931122, 863332, 103142, '<td valign="top">So what is on the poppy? Is it some sort of wrap to keep it closed? Love the bokeh on this shot. I don''t know which one I like better. I think this one has more interest and the other has more beauty. I think it''s a wash in my mind -- I gave this one a 7, and I''m pretty sure that''s what I would score the other.</td>', 'So what is on the poppy? Is it some sort of wrap to keep it closed? Love the bokeh on this shot. I don''t know which one I like better. I think this one has more interest and the other has more beauty. I think it''s a wash in my mind -- I gave this one a 7, and I''m pretty sure that''s what I would score the other.', '2010-04-05 05:39:23.000000', NULL, 0),
