(5931158, 863590, 28427, '<td valign="top">Indeed, a lot of erupting volcano''s in this challenge.  But then, how many times does one have the opportunity of shooting a volcano in eruption that was dormant for 200 years and on top of it during a period were "orange" was the theme of the challenge.<br/>I find you''ve managed well in not having the surroundings too dark and the eruption not over exposed.</td>', 'Indeed, a lot of erupting volcano''s in this challenge.  But then, how many times does one have the opportunity of shooting a volcano in eruption that was dormant for 200 years and on top of it during a period were "orange" was the theme of the challenge.I find you''ve managed well in not having the surroundings too dark and the eruption not over exposed.', '2010-04-05 06:16:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(5931160, 863407, 66635, '<td valign="top">Just great!  I love the colors and everything about it.</td>', 'Just great!  I love the colors and everything about it.', '2010-04-05 06:19:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(5931161, 863579, 28427, '<td valign="top">Once a different angle on a flower.  Most of the time, people photograph the head of the flower and not the bottom.  I like the depth you''ve created by letting in some shadow parts at the left of the flower.  Well done.</td>', 'Once a different angle on a flower.  Most of the time, people photograph the head of the flower and not the bottom.  I like the depth you''ve created by letting in some shadow parts at the left of the flower.  Well done.', '2010-04-05 06:19:17.000000', NULL, 0),
