(5931486, 863498, 95418, '<td valign="top">From the Critique Club:<br/> <br/>When I saw this picture stopped breathing.<br/> <br/>From my point of view it is very good, almost perfect.<br/>The color, the curves, the theme, the light, the composition and the focus are very good.<br/> <br/>Maybe I put the theme a little farther.<br/> <br/>In a word, this image moves me to reflect on the beauty of things (which I appreciate so much).<br/> <br/>Congratulations!<br/> <br/>Regards,<br/> <br/>Oscar Burd</td>', 'From the Critique Club: When I saw this picture stopped breathing. From my point of view it is very good, almost perfect.The color, the curves, the theme, the light, the composition and the focus are very good. Maybe I put the theme a little farther. In a word, this image moves me to reflect on the beauty of things (which I appreciate so much). Congratulations! Regards, Oscar Burd', '2010-04-05 10:28:40.000000', NULL, 0),
