(5933087, 863332, 35545, '<td valign="top">I really like your DOF.  I''ve never noticed the beautiful "wrapping" texture in the bud of a California poppy.  My only suggestion would be to get the whole bud in the shot -- as I recall, they come to a neat point which would add some more visual interest (IMNSHO).  Maybe put the bud on the diagonal?  Lovely colors and forms in the background.</td>', 'I really like your DOF.  I''ve never noticed the beautiful "wrapping" texture in the bud of a California poppy.  My only suggestion would be to get the whole bud in the shot -- as I recall, they come to a neat point which would add some more visual interest (IMNSHO).  Maybe put the bud on the diagonal?  Lovely colors and forms in the background.', '2010-04-06 08:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
