(5934637, 863498, 86218, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I tried to capture something simeler the day before (not nearly as good)but was not happy with my takes on the rose and rather declined on entering. On opening of challenge browsing through the pics my eye caught this and knew this was the one I was looking for...and it would end up on the front page (yea right :)) Congrats on a super image well presented and amazing how such a simple pic can evoke so much emotions with the lines in it. You have an eye!</td>', 'Great shot. I tried to capture something simeler the day before (not nearly as good)but was not happy with my takes on the rose and rather declined on entering. On opening of challenge browsing through the pics my eye caught this and knew this was the one I was looking for...and it would end up on the front page (yea right :)) Congrats on a super image well presented and amazing how such a simple pic can evoke so much emotions with the lines in it. You have an eye!', '2010-04-07 03:44:42.000000', NULL, 0),
